WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
At a time when we had given up all hope,

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.700
we decided to come to the Miracle Dome.

3
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.600
At the altar,

4
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.600
Prophet Jerome Fernando

5
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.800
laid hands on them and declared life.

6
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.600
She's walking

7
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.700
without the walker after...

8
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:16.600
Tell us what happened, mother.

9
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.600
I was paralysed in 2018.

10
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.600
So, you're the lady

11
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:26.700
who had an issue on the left knee.

12
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.700
You showed me exactly like this that day.

13
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.600
Prophet, this is Disna.

14
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.600
For one and a half years,

15
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.600
she had cancer,

16
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.600
and then she had a lung disease

17
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:39.600
due to the chemotherapy,

18
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.700
and she has been on this oxygen machine.

19
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.700
After Prophet laid hands on him,

20
00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:58.600
Prophet of God

21
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.600
ministered to him a couple of years ago,

22
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.600
and last October,

23
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:05.600
he not only won a speech competition,

24
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.600
he won first place

25
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.700
in the impromptu speech competition.

26
00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:11.700
This doesn't make sense.

27
00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:12.900
It has to be...
